abstract: >-
 Given a large library of graphs finding which of them are not in a given host graph. It allows 4 different types of filtering, all requiering preprocess on the library, then for every given host graph filtering can be done using the preprocess cache. This package also offeres a tool for efficently searching for subgraph in a graph, using the VELCRO algorithm.
